{"format_version":1,"id":"18cad991810db8ed2c65e126eea64ced912b67d5223006d1","commits":["f8732f454f4dd92310e84dfe5123841c8feb7675"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Assembly deploy documentation matches the deploy.** The blog guide now describes `selfblog assembly integrate` (the deploy body) and `selfblog assembly sync-workflow` (which regenerates the deployed workflow and its selfblog pin) instead of the retired embedded-shell workflow.","type":"fix","packages":["selfdoc"]}
