{"format_version":1,"id":"18cad9d975d24edbb640bb1ba47746ffb5e4684a3d5c6372","commits":["96e30729e68c4cbe6597faa296df55b083986e49"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**`selfdoc init` works on projects with no code, and emits a config that builds.** Language detection failing is no longer a refusal: a codeless project gets a config with no `source` key and a starter page with no extraction directive. Every field load and build require -- base URL, versions, locales -- is written into the file, so the generated configuration needs no hand-editing.","type":"feature","packages":["selfdoc"]}
{"format_version":1,"id":"18cad9da898fdba5300b23f22c164d66a8a3900b20a40b71","commits":["96e30729e68c4cbe6597faa296df55b083986e49"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**`selfdoc init` requires `--base-url`.** The site's own address cannot be inferred and every canonical link, sitemap entry and feed URL is built from it, so init now takes it explicitly.","type":"breaking","packages":["selfdoc"]}
